03_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"七三不嚼作聲食七三五七〈不填頰食別有六一〈不換頰嚼食別","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"五六不毀呰食有六〇不叱笑","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"今缺〉　他食六二不彈","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"舌食今缺〉","sortOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"七四不全吞食食佚","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"七五不未咽食食佚","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"七六不吐食食七六五九〈別有六〇不作五八〈別有六八不作","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"塔形食今缺〉塔形食今缺〉","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"七七不齅鼻食七五","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"七八不舐手食七八六一　六四","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"七九不指抆鉢食七九六二〈不舐鉢食〉　六五〈不刮鉢舌舐〉","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"八〇不棄飯食八〇","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"八一不振手食八一六三〈別有六四不振六六〈別有六七不振","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"鉢食今缺〉　鉢內食今缺〉","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"八二不汙手受器八二六七〈不汚手捉淨瓶〉　七〇〈同有部〉","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"八三不爲自索羹佚　四二〈不預伸鉢〉　四五〈同有部〉","sortOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"八四不覆羹望得八三五〇〈幷雲以羹覆飯四六〈同有部別有四","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_103","text":"別有四三不安七不安鉢食上","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_103_123","chapte